  {
    "title": "你只是在‘上班’，还是在‘创造’？",
    "seo_summary": "聚焦“上班”与“创造”的本质区别。揭示多数人为何感到空虚，并指出如何从执行指令转向主动创造价值。帮你认清职业与个人使命的边界。",
    "url": "https://seths.blog/2026/05/doing-your-job-vs-doing-your-work",
    "cover": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-renzhi-hub/main/assets/rss_covers/7ad6b562dd933934.jpg",
    "wechat_html": "<section style='margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#fff;'><img src='https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/3hAJnwuyZuicicZkgJBUCCaricdibomDBrTzXgUR7FJnf11qGIo8nmKt6RxibXrb5s4RFb9UZ9UOHQy7fqQyI377Licw/0?wx_fmt=gif' style='width:100%;display:block;'><section style='padding:0;'><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">每天你准时打卡，完成老板布置的任务，觉得自己很努力。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">但你内心深处，是否隐隐觉得少了点什么？</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">残酷的真相是，你可能只是在“做一份工”，而不是在“做自己的事”。</p><img peitu='true' src='https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-renzhi-hub/main/assets/rss_covers/7ad6b562dd933934.jpg' style='width:100%;display:block;margin:30px 0;'><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">很多人活了一辈子，都没有真正区分“做一份工”和“做自己的事”有何不同。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">如果你也分不清，那么大概率，你只是在执行别人给你设定的指令。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">你领一份薪水，按要求完成任务，这叫“做一份工”。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">它有明确的边界和清晰的流程，你只需要遵循既定的规章制度。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">但“做自己的事”完全不同。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">它不是别人分配给你的，也不是你通过简历投递得来的。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">它更像一种内心的召唤，是你主动选择的创造、改变和责任。</p><section style=\"margin:50px 0 25px 0; border-bottom:1px solid #E5E5E5; padding-bottom:12px; display:flex; align-items:center;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block; width:5px; height:18px; background-color:#111; margin-right:12px;\"></span><strong style=\"font-size:19px; color:#111; letter-spacing:1.5px;\">你为谁而“工作”？</strong></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">真正的“工作”，是你渴望带来的改变。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">它可能体现在你想服务的人群。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">体现在你想解决的痛点。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">也体现在你坚持要负责的那些决策里。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">这中间最大的区别，<strong style=\"color:#000; font-weight:bold;\">不是你听从谁的指令，而是你回应了谁的召唤。</strong></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">你不是被动地完成任务，你是主动地去创造价值。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">你不是为了打卡而打卡，你是为了心中的愿景而投入。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">所以，如果你发现自己每天都在重复枯燥的流程。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">感觉不到成就感和意义。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">那不是因为你不够努力。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">而是你可能还没有找到，或者还没有开始真正“做自己的事”。</p><section style=\"margin:50px 0 25px 0; border-bottom:1px solid #E5E5E5; padding-bottom:12px; display:flex; align-items:center;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block; width:5px; height:18px; background-color:#111; margin-right:12px;\"></span><strong style=\"font-size:19px; color:#111; letter-spacing:1.5px;\">如何从“上班”走向“创造”？</strong></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">想从“做一份工”转向“做自己的事”，你得先问自己：究竟想改变什么？</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">这个改变可以是微小的，比如让团队沟通更顺畅。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">也可以是宏大的，比如为某个群体提供更好的解决方案。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">关键在于，这个愿望必须发自你内心。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">并且你愿意为此承担责任。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">当你把目光从“我应该做什么”转向“我能创造什么”时。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">你的视角就会彻底改变。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">你会开始寻找机会。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">主动承担那些能带来影响力的项目，而不是仅仅等待指令。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">你不再把自己看作一个齿轮。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">而是看作一台发动机，推动事情向前发展。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">别再只顾着上班打卡了。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">去找到你真正想做的事。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">主动选择，别再等待。</p><section style='margin:45px 0 20px 0;padding-top:20px;border-top:1px solid #E5E5E5;'><section style='font-size:13px;color:#999;margin-bottom:12px;text-transform:uppercase;'>TAGS</section><section><span style='display:inline-block;margin:0 10px 10px 0;padding:4px 12px;border:1px solid #DCDFE6;color:#606266;font-size:12px;'>职业发展</span><span style='display:inline-block;margin:0 10px 10px 0;padding:4px 12px;border:1px solid #DCDFE6;color:#606266;font-size:12px;'>个人成长</span><span style='display:inline-block;margin:0 10px 10px 0;padding:4px 12px;border:1px solid #DCDFE6;color:#606266;font-size:12px;'>思维模式</span><span style='display:inline-block;margin:0 10px 10px 0;padding:4px 12px;border:1px solid #DCDFE6;color:#606266;font-size:12px;'>价值创造</span><span style='display:inline-block;margin:0 10px 10px 0;padding:4px 12px;border:1px solid #DCDFE6;color:#606266;font-size:12px;'>工作意义</span></section></section></section><img src='https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/3hAJnwuyZuicicZkgJBUCCaricdibomDBrTzk57DCmhVC16o9ILH0Tn1YPEiarfLRRQSVFN2mJdeYibGnBPialPIzvojw/0?wx_fmt=gif' style='width:100%;display:block;'></section>",
    "generated_at": "2026-05-30 10:50:44",
    "is_daily_featured": true
